notes:        Chunks (Transform property records with static values and with keys, a null layer and its hidden solid) extracted by crates/aep-export/examples/mkprotos from a project the contributor generated with Adobe After Effects 2026 (one composition, a solid layer with static Transform values, a solid layer with two keys on every Transform property, a null layer); synthetic structure only, no third-party content or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used.
